            "title": "410 Denim",
            "text": "<p>Our 410 denim refers to our washed denim pieces, designed for immediate comfort and a vintage look. Washed denim has been pre-treated to soften the fabric. 410 indicates the weight of our denim which is equivalent to a heavy denim. Hand wash cold and wash inside out. We recommend air drying or hang dry to prevent shrinkage and preserve the shape. Iron on low heat or steam post wash. Use a soft detergent, avoid frequent washing to extend the lifespan of your denim piece. Spot clean where needed.</p>",
