            "title": "440 Denim",
            "text": "<p>Our 440 denim is raw denim in its purest form, untreated and unwashed- allowing it to develop a completely personal fade over time. Cold hand wash separately, and wash inside out. Colour may transfer when new. We recommend air drying or hang dry to prevent shrinkage and preserve the shape. Iron on low heat or steam post wash. Use a soft detergent, avoid frequent washing to extend the lifespan of your denim piece. Spot clean where needed. The fabric is stiff when new and later softens over time with each wear. Expect natural fading over time.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
